## Tables Cleaned

### Full Cleanup List

| Table | Relationship | Cleanup Method |
|-------|--------------|----------------|
| creature_addon | guid → creature.guid | LEFT JOIN + IS NULL |
| creature_formations | leaderGUID/memberGUID → guid | Two passes |
| linked_respawn | guid/linkedGuid → guid | Filter by linkType |
| creature_movement_override | guid → creature.guid | LEFT JOIN + IS NULL |
| game_event_creature | guid → creature.guid | LEFT JOIN + IS NULL |
| pool_creature | guid → creature.guid | LEFT JOIN + IS NULL |
| conditions | ConditionValue3 → guid (when type 31) | Filtered by type |
| smart_scripts | ABS(entryorguid) → guid (when negative) | GUID overrides only |

### Special Case: SmartAI GUID Overrides

SmartAI stores per-spawn script overrides as **negative entryorguid**:
```sql
-- Template script (all creatures of this type)
INSERT INTO smart_scripts (entryorguid, source_type, ...)
VALUES (12345, 0, ...);  -- Positive = template

-- GUID override (specific spawn)
INSERT INTO smart_scripts (entryorguid, source_type, ...)
VALUES (-153067, 0, ...);  -- Negative = GUID override for spawn 153067
```

**Cleanup:**
```sql
DELETE FROM smart_scripts
WHERE source_type = 0  -- Creature scripts
  AND entryorguid < 0  -- GUID overrides
  AND ABS(entryorguid) NOT IN (SELECT guid FROM critter_guids);
```

